      "type": "event",
      "date": "2026-06-02T15:27:00.000Z",
      "title": "Goodyear India Limited Announces Appointment of Arvind Bhandari as Chairman of the Board, Effective June 2, 2026",
      "body": "Goodyear India Limited announced that, effective June 2, 2026, Arvind Bhandari became Chairman of the Board of Directors. Bhandari brings more than 25 years of experience to his new role and has worked across categories covering the complete consumer space at large Indian firms as well as global multinationals like ITC, Pepsi, and Nestle. His career spans sales, branding, marketing, and general management roles in India, South Africa, and Switzerland, with a global reach across Asia, Africa, LATAM, the Middle East, and the USA. Most recently Managing Director of Nestle Eastern Africa, Bhandari's notable roles include Global CEO of Wyeth Nutrition, EVP Regional Business Head at Nestle Nutrition, and Managing Director for Eastern Horn of Africa. Bhandari is an MBA from SP Jain University, Mu",
      "keyDevTypeId": "16",
      "source_url": null,
      "raw_subtype": "EventActivity"
    },
    {
      "id": "d8627765-9f06-4d7e-a7c8-a8eccc6b138a",
      "type": "brief",
      "date": "2026-05-30T20:28:25.000Z",
      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹26.66 (vs ₹23.90 in FY 2025)",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹26.66 (up from ₹23.90 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹24.9b (down 4.4% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹615.0m (up 12% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 2.5% (up from 2.1% in FY 2025). Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 40% per year but the company’s share price has only fallen by 15% per year, which means it has not declined as severely as earnings.",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
      "source_url": null,
