      "date": "2026-05-28T11:51:00.000Z",
      "title": "Goodyear India Limited Approves Appointment of Vinay Kumar as Head-Legal & Compliance (Senior Management Personnel), Effective from June 01, 2026",
      "body": "Goodyear India Limited at its board meeting held on May 28, 2026, based on the recommendation of the Nomination & Remuneration Committee, approved the appointment of Mr. Vinay Kumar as Head-Legal & Compliance (Senior Management Personnel) of the Company effective from June 01, 2026. Mr. Vinay Kumar is a Post Graduate in Law and a Fellow Company Secretary with over 25 years of experience in company secretarial functions, securities laws (including SEBI and SEC), foreign exchange laws, corporate and international legal matters, cross-border transactions, litigation, corporate restructuring, mergers and acquisitions, intellectual property, and drafting and vetting of commercial agreements. He is well-versed in compliance areas such as FCPA, anti-trust, ethics training, investigations, regulat",
